+// PGenerator: the draw colour as sent to the shaders. ofStyle stores colours
+// as 8 bit ofColor, so a 10 bit code (513/1023) arrived as 128/255 and the
+// shaders got it back from currentStyle on every bind. One renderer per
+// process, so a file static keeps the class layout of stock 0.11.2.
+static ofFloatColor pgExactColor(1.f,1.f,1.f,1.f);
+static inline float pgClamp01(float v){ return v < 0.f ? 0.f : (v > 1.f ? 1.f : v); }
 
